镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-video-prompts/references/minimax-h3.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-video-prompts","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-e0ffcd9c66bf","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"反派设计四阶体系","description":"``` ╱╲ ╱T4╲ 隐藏 Boss（终极反转） ╱────╲ ╱ T3 ╲ 大反派（终极对手） ╱────────╲ ╱ T2 ╲ 中反派（主要对手） ╱────────────╲ ╱ T1 ╲ 小反派（炮灰） ╱────────────────╲ ```","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["OmniMux-skills-short-dr…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/OmniMux-skills-short-drama-screenwriter/references/villain-design.md","ext":".md","pack":"OmniMux-skills-short-drama-screenwriter","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-e63d64e5cee8","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"权属与版权投诉","description":"来源：","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["opc-skills-tiktok-drama…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/opc-skills-tiktok-drama-center/references/rights.md","ext":".md","pack":"opc-skills-tiktok-drama-center","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-e6492fbe0fe4","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"开篇黄金法则","description":"微短剧观众的注意力窗口极短。如果前5秒没有抓住他们，手指一划就流失了。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["short-drama","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/short-drama/references/opening-rules.md","ext":".md","pack":"short-drama","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-ea7bb7d2d226","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"钩子设计手册","description":"观众看完一集，手指悬在屏幕上——划走还是继续？这个决定在最后10秒做出。钩子的作用就是让那根手指\"划不动\"。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["OmniMux-skills-short-dr…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/OmniMux-skills-short-drama-series-writer/references/hook-design.md","ext":".md","pack":"OmniMux-skills-short-drama-series-writer","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-ecc8be4caed4","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"中文短剧 Markdown 剧本格式","description":"1. 设计目标与事实所有权 2. 文件、集与场景结构 3. 动作、对白与生产标签 4. 注释与未知内容 5. 完整格式示例 6. 稳定 ID、临时索引与修订 7. 现有文本的规范化入口 8. 剧本中不应出现的内容 9. 完成前检查","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-write/references/screenplay-format.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-write","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-eeee9c363ad8","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"音乐 Prompt 工程指南","description":"为 Music API 构建高质量 prompt 的参考词汇表。Prompt 应使用英文。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["OmniMux-skills-drama-so…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/OmniMux-skills-drama-soundtrack/references/music-prompt-guide.md","ext":".md","pack":"OmniMux-skills-drama-soundtrack","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-efb6d598bb1c","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"生产分镜工艺：把剧本事实编成可审查镜头","description":"来自对剧本拍、分镜、关键帧与视频提示词如何衔接的定性案例阅读，示例均为合成改写。 方法论见 [shot-craft.md](shot-craft.md) 与 [keyframe-craft.md](keyframe-craft.md)； 本文档是生产端的转换规则和判断依据。出现的数字只有被创作者纳入项目方案 （`craft_default`）后才是验收条件，不能只因偏离示例就判为问题。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-storyboard/references/production-shot-grammar.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-storyboard","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-f1867706e7ef","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"审查阶段契约","description":"本阶段只拥有审查结论与修订要求，不改写 owner 来源。需要落盘时使用创作者可读 Markdown，引用当前 文件名、标题 ID、行号或短引文；不建立 JSON/JSONL、来源快照、哈希或接受状态。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-review/references/stage-contract.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-review","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-f6528b43ea39","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"把视觉方向翻译成制作形态","description":"视觉风格不是贴在提示词前面的标签。先把创作者已接受的 `visual_direction` 和 `production_profile` 拆成可观察、可复核的选择，再让各负责人只投影本阶段需要的部分。 同一故事事实可以有多种制作形态；这里给的是提问维度、构成差异和责任边界，不是固定风格套餐。 逐形态的执行细节放在 `references/form-cards/` 的六张卡里，本文只负责怎么选、 提示词构成随形态改变什么、以及各阶段拿走什么。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-drama","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama/references/production-form-profiles.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-f7a14f026d4a","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"爽点与反派（satisfaction & villain）——治「没爽点 / 反派工具人」","description":"> 短剧的引擎是**情绪价值**。爽点烂 90% 是因为反派太弱、或\"越打越同级\"。写 series-bible 的爽点曲线 + 反派阶梯时读本文。 > 方法论借鉴 0xsline/short-drama（satisfaction-matrix / villain-design）。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["Easel-short-drama","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/Easel-short-drama/references/satisfaction-and-villain.md","ext":".md","pack":"Easel-short-drama","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-f88d48d3654d","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"故事引擎（story engine）——治「剧情简单 / 人物扁平」的根","description":"> 剧情烂的根因不是\"题材选错\"，而是**没有引擎**：事件是\"然后…然后…\"堆的、人物是被作者推着走的、反转是空降的。 > 本文给一套**因果驱动 + 人物能动**的故事引擎。**写 series-bible 前必读**；每个主要角色必须建\"行动模型\"。 > 方法论借鉴 worldwonderer/drama-skills（story-craft）。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["Easel-short-drama","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/Easel-short-drama/references/story-engine.md","ext":".md","pack":"Easel-short-drama","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-f92c76362096","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"漫剧关键帧视觉词表","description":"项目视觉方向接受为漫剧 / 二维漫画形态后，写关键帧 `generic_prompt` 的人会撞上同一个 问题：身份、地理、边界事实都绑好了，但“这一帧怎样投影已接受的画风、当前镜头要防什么 可读性风险”每次都要重新发明措辞，同一个项目里不同集的提示词各说各话。这份词表把 项目级画风基底与镜头级可选词分开，让同一项目复用一份视觉语言，又不把镜头差异抹平。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-storyboard/references/comic-keyframe-lexicon.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-storyboard","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-f9ff5da55c2e","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"FAQ 速查","description":"来源：https://www.tiktokdramacenter.com/help-center/detail/6a0ed1ce40280804f5db5417 （2026-08-13 13:37）","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["opc-skills-tiktok-drama…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/opc-skills-tiktok-drama-center/references/qa.md","ext":".md","pack":"opc-skills-tiktok-drama-center","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-fa380e636c02","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"角色 / 画面一致性（短剧最难的技术点）","description":"> 本文件只管**外貌/画面一致性**（同一角色跨镜跨集长相不崩）。 > 角色的**内在深度**（行动模型 / want·need·wound·flaw / 弧光 / 可跟随四问 / 台词区分度）见 > `story-engine.md` + `dialogue-craft.md`——那才是治「人物扁平」的地方，别混淆。 > > AI 生成的最大痛点：同一角色在不同镜头/不同集里长相会变。业界共识的解法是 > **「先定角色参考图，再图生视频(I2V)，而非纯文生视频」**…","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["Easel-short-drama","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/Easel-short-drama/references/character-consistency.md","ext":".md","pack":"Easel-short-drama","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-fa61e52d15c0","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"Seedance 2.0 提示词方言","description":"只在目标档案明确写 `target_video_model: seedance-2.0` 时使用。推荐档案：","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-video-prompts/references/seedance-2.0.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-video-prompts","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-fe26ce8791ec","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"改编压缩、合并与信息视觉化","description":"改编不是把原文缩短，也不是为短剧补一套流行结构。目标是保留原材料真正承担的戏剧功能， 再为屏幕、单集边界和制作条件寻找新的载体。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-develop/references/adaptation-craft.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-develop","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-fe90b2e9ef35","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"规则与路由索引","description":"本文件只做两件事：把每类决策路由到**负责的技能**，以及定义规则分级与冲突优先级。 它不复制任何规则正文——每个技能的预检、所有权边界、形态输入与完整规则表，都在该技能 自己的 `references/stage-contract.md` 里。核心不代子技能决定读哪一份资料。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-drama","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama/references/knowhow-index.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-ff953def97d6","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"Character / Look 设计","description":"1. 分工 2. Character：最小稳定识别集 3. Look：一次相容的外观组合 4. 可选声音方向：身份锚点不等于本场 delivery 5. 制作形态与身份锚点的可表达性 6. 合成例：顾禾 7. 角色 设定集 的实用检查","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-assets/references/character-and-look.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-assets","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-ffa2d17dbc58","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"Seedance 2.5 提示词方言","description":"只在目标档案明确写 `target_video_model: seedance-2.5` 时使用。推荐档案：","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-video-prompts/references/seedance-2.5.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-video-prompts","bytes":null}}]}
